# Eye detection validation — NEVER commit private photos, crops, labels, or reports.
# This whole folder is local-only. Do not force-add anything inside it.
eye-validation/
eye-validation/**
**/eye-validation/photos/
**/eye-validation/crops/
**/eye-validation/ground_truth.json
**/eye-validation/failure-review.html
**/eye-validation/results/

# Local user data and generated caches never belong in source control.
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/thumbnails/
**/.ollama/
**/target/
.qa/native-*/
**/__pycache__/
.qa/*.log
